message: >-
  This file describes the MCP-Eco companion code. To cite MCP-Eco, please cite
  the paper given as the preferred citation and name the dataset revision you
  used.
type: software
title: MCP-Eco companion code
abstract: >-
  Scripts and queries that download, verify, and query the pinned MCP-Eco
  dataset release, and that rerun the paper's code listing and worked examples.
